### 유저 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "alice", "email": "alice@example.com", "password": "RANDOMPASSWORD"}

### 이메일 빈값
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "alice", "email": ""}

### 이름 누락
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### 조회 단건
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1

### 존재 안할 때
GET http://localhost:8080/users/99999999

### 조회 문자열 
GET http://localhost:8080/users/string

### 쿼리로
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1?id=1




### 빈 이름
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": ""}

### 공백 이름
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "   "}

### 너무 긴 이름
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"}


### 공백 Body
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 숫자가 아닌 id
GET http://localhost:8080/users/abc

### 지원하지 않는 메서드
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users